=== REASONING ===
1. Hook: useVehiclePositions returns Position[] with lat/lon. No leaflet.heat plugin in @/components/maps barrel.
2. Strategy: Use CircleMarker with opacity proportional to visit frequency (grid-based density clustering).
3. Clustering: Grid-based — bucket positions by rounded lat/lon, count per bucket, normalise to 0–1 intensity.
4. WidgetMapView handles map container, tile layer, zoom controls, empty state — pass clusters as CircleMarker children.
5. Compact (1-col): WidgetMapView with compact=true (no scroll/zoom/drag), smaller circles.
6. Standard (2×4): WidgetMapView with title, icon, density circles.
7. Wide (3×4+): Larger map, more detail, position count badge.
8. Lucide Map icon conflicts with JS Map constructor — alias as MapIcon.
9. All strings i18n via t(). Null-safe: positions ?? []. useMemo for clustering.

